summary:
  The history looks for a repeat in the newest row only.

history:
  That was the whole rule until 2026-09-23, and two slogans taking turns
  beat it every time: neither ever matched the row just above it.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TrackLogic.js

find:
      var n = Math.min(rows.count, HISTORY_LOOKBACK);

replace:
      var n = Math.min(rows.count, 1);

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_tracklogic.qml::test_a_slogan_taking_turns_with_songs_gets_one_row.
  Line-neutral.
